{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《夫妻的博弈》自播出以來話題不斷，當中由高海寧領軍，聯同游嘉欣、李海銅、楊卓娜及何沛珈組成的「SHERO」組合更是備受矚目，更成功揮低張穎康和鄧智堅，令一眾觀眾看得大快人心，直呼過癮！</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744303996150665_3935946.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026NQrb2H2FEQ1786331705.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744303996150665_3935946.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">日前，劇組為《夫妻的博弈》舉行宣傳活動造勢。李海銅事後在社交平台晒出與好姊妹的幕後溫馨合照。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">相中可見她與游嘉欣及楊卓娜齊齊對着鏡頭擺出可愛萌甫，足見她們無論戲裏戲外都感情要好。不過，這張閨密照唯獨欠缺了高海寧與何沛珈的身影，難怪海銅亦忍不住發文嘆息：「思穎、𤋮妍👭 娜姐!!!!!! SHERO五缺二！」不少網民都敲碗希望盡快看到五女合體。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304012946184_3935946.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026mgrylQmil21786331704.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304012946184_3935946.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744303987776050_3935946.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026EnN2eGw8ar1786331704.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744303987776050_3935946.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304138788493_3935946.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026CBW6z3ZopD1786331705.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304138788493_3935946.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304138777669_3935946.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026igPaarMb2I1786331705.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"_lhtung__1786269602_3959744304138777669_3935946.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了大晒姊妹情，海銅亦不忘在帖文中感謝粉絲的窩心應援。她冧爆表示每次出席活動都感受到大家滿滿的愛：「每次活動都會收穫滿滿的❤️ 每次都會收到大家送上大量零食餵飽我🤭 每一封手寫信我都會認真睇💌 每一樣親手做的禮物我都會好好珍惜❤️ 多謝你哋！」盡顯親民寵粉的一面！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T05:42:45.469541+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":397,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}